$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=z5dlog2  LOC_AFTER=?

* log 2 >_ 56 / 81 (set.mm's log2tlbnd at N = 2: log 2 exceeds the partial sum 2 / 3 + 2 / 81 of its series).  It makes 8 ^ n beat e ^ ( 2 n ) by the factor e ^ ( 2 n / 27 ) in the Gamma bound.

